OL,3,AAppeal court judges overturn ban on
OL,4,Acontroversial Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Court of Appeal has overturned a
OL,7,Fban on Orangemen marching through a
OL,8,Flargely nationalist part of Northern
OL,9,FIreland on Sunday.
OL,11,FHowever in a further development, the
OL,12,FCourt of Appeal has approved a request
OL,13,Ffor the case to be heard tonight by a
OL,14,Fdifferent High Court judge.
OL,16,FThe Drumcree parade, which in the 1990s
OL,17,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,18,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history,
OL,19,Fhad been given permission to go ahead
OL,20,Falong the Garvaghy Road in Portadown
OL,21,Ffor the first time in almost three
OL,22,Fdecades, with restrictions in place.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
