OL,3,AAppeal court judges overturn ban on
OL,4,Acontroversial Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat decision was challenged in court
OL,7,Fon Saturday by the Garvaghy Road
OL,8,FResidents Group and a High Court judge
OL,9,Fissued an injunction halting the march
OL,10,Fruling the "long-running dispute"
OL,11,Fbetween residents and local Orangemen
OL,12,Fhad "the potential to escalate" should
OL,13,Fit proceed.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
